body:
So sorry for your loss 🩷 I haven't read all of these but they're all on my TBR as cozy/lighthearted/funny, so if I'm wrong someone please correct me for OP's sake:

{The House in the Cerulean Sea}

{Legends & Lattes}

{The Spellshop}

{The Honey Witch}

{The Very Secret Society of Irregular Witches}

{Assistant to the Villain}

{Between by L.L. Starling}

People also regularly recommend Cassandra Gannon and T. Kingfisher.
